    "minimumQualification": "Bachelor's degree in Mechanical Engineering or related field. Any Professional certifications are a plus. Experience Minimum of 0-4 years of experience in mechanical design/ presales activity of industrial automation projects in particular gantry automation, robotic automation projects. Strong understanding of mechanical design principles, materials, manufacturing processes, cost estimation. Technical Skills Proficiency in CAD software (e.g., SolidWorks, AutoCAD). Expertise in mechanical design for industrial automation applications, including robotics, conveyors, actuators, and custom automation equipment. Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic environment and manage competing priorities.",
